    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Read-path p99 latency (SLO < 800ms)",
      "description": "Backend request-duration p99 for GET and HEAD read methods. Histogram estimates require the new subsecond bucket configuration for precise results; historical coarse buckets cannot recover measured percentile detail.",
